  "question": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8cc3bec3-f897-4ca7-b33b-0a5a3ad55018-image.png\" style=\"width: 263px; height: 134px;\" /></p><p>In the above reaction, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of benzene on nitration gives <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of nitrobenzene. The percentage yield of nitrobenzene in the above reaction is _________&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>%</mo></math>. (Round off to the Nearest Integer).</p><p>(Given atomic mass : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></math>)</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "80",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4d3a1c64-a3eb-411d-977c-75a16052346b-image.png\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 181px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>gm</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>123</mn><mn>78</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>gm</mi></math></p><p>But actual amount of nitrobenzene formed is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>gm</mi></math> and hence.</p><p>Percentage yield<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>92</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p>",
